  "releaseNotes": "0.9.8.0 — Bounded UpdateOverlay retry chain (eliminates dispatcher flood); EagerContentKey bypass for migrated panels (LazyContentPlaceholder fix); active panel overlay alignment at startup; Threads + Parallel Stacks panels with full 28-locale localization; WorkspaceFindReplace panel redesign (29 keys × 28 locales); +10 new languages (uk-UA, cs-CZ, vi-VN, hu-HU, ro-RO, id-ID, th-TH, el-GR, da-DK, fi-FI), reaching 28 total. 0.9.7.0 — Horizontal reorder for docked tool-panel tabs; tab-switch triple-fire eliminated (perf); toolbar StaticResource labels fix; Phase 5+6 full localization (17 languages).",
